    },
    {
      "id": "cleanup-and-receipts",
      "source": "desktop-backend-smoke.ts:627-641,679-777,793-797; desktop-opencode-v2-cold-metadata.ts:92-116,150-225",
      "finding": "Guarded Quit waits actual selected Host absence, requires metadata release lineage and physical absence before harness cleanup. Finally preserves source checks, identity-guarded cleanup and receipt even on failure; incomplete/null/nonempty cleanup makes receipt incomplete and the cleanup assertion fails. Original finite model closes in outer finally. Inline CI validation must still require both receipt statuses PASS, not only process exit."
    }
